{"w":2400,"h":3209,"lines":[{"t":"Reading","h":0.017322805291766996,"c":1,"y":0.033928314993752151,"w":0.080627110799153634,"x":0.82304432853830389},{"w":0.81569279988606769,"x":0.071770809004294348,"t":"D For green roofs to become the norm for new developments, there needs to be support from","c":1,"h":0.020963803110092938,"y":0.084160453999539087},{"w":0.75944483439127608,"c":1,"t":"public authorities and private investors. Those responsible for maintaining buildings may","y":0.10234996744205238,"h":0.021543710773979097,"x":0.11638144614060365},{"y":0.12087789942873484,"x":0.11639805606773004,"t":"have to acquire new skills, such as landscaping, and in some cases, volunteers may be","c":1,"w":0.73418131510416673,"h":0.022532783341927654},{"w":0.76310679117838542,"c":1,"y":0.14236760150527461,"h":0.017516119532124619,"t":"needed to help out. Other considerations include installing drainage paths, meeting health","x":0.11650485679095331},{"w":0.7458360799153646,"c":1,"x":0.11639306098254186,"y":0.15931386706452144,"h":0.022241082592545314,"t":"and safety requirements and perhaps allowing access for the public, as well as planning"},{"y":0.17877907004069105,"t":"restrictions and disruption from regular activities in and around the buildings during","h":0.019040244390660099,"c":1,"x":0.11650485302866344,"w":0.71844660441080732},{"c":1,"h":0.017590378972228815,"x":0.1145631041322782,"y":0.19767441848825129,"t":"installation. To convince investors and developers that installing green roofs is worthwhile,","w":0.78058252970377595},{"h":0.022320663594753931,"c":1,"t":"economic arguments are still the most important. The term 'natural capital' has been","x":0.11636656656748547,"y":0.2138362714330887,"w":0.71870152791341146},{"t":"developed to explain the economic value of nature; for example, measuring the money","h":0.017494385264744228,"c":1,"x":0.11650485580043721,"w":0.73786407470703119,"y":0.23546511616353949},{"y":0.25420560730430708,"w":0.72815531412760415,"h":0.017596718381126975,"c":1,"x":0.11650486725368817,"t":"saved by installing natural solutions to protect against flood damage, adapt to climate"},{"t":"change or help people lead healthier and happier lives.","y":0.2732087225225297,"x":0.11650485122776288,"h":0.017488951994993895,"w":0.46796117146809901,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.31104651143598516,"w":0.015533979733784994,"t":"E","x":0.071844660521457035,"h":0.01308139551465759},{"w":0.714793955485026,"y":0.30777906590302639,"c":1,"x":0.11446967045610298,"h":0.02267155632423079,"t":"As the expertise about green roofs grows, official standards have been developed to"},{"h":0.019034811120909545,"y":0.32834890952948226,"t":"ensure that they are designed, constructed and maintained properly, and function well.","w":0.73592234293619796,"c":1,"x":0.1165048478876264},{"x":0.11644781872331436,"c":1,"w":0.75545903523763014,"h":0.020290583910600457,"y":0.34581884808435026,"t":"Improvements in the science and technology underpinning green roof development have"},{"c":1,"t":"also led to new variations in the concept. For example,iblue roofs' enable buildings to hold","w":0.78464309692382805,"h":0.021387820377528177,"y":0.36403221602422509,"x":0.11448220703353514},{"h":0.023423426025010352,"y":0.38212915468146935,"c":1,"t":"water over longer periods of time, rather than draining it away quickly - crucial in times of","w":0.77890126546223959,"x":0.11833566417421328},{"c":1,"y":0.40246501470488316,"w":0.76322168986002603,"x":0.118392107761883,"h":0.020605499647859515,"t":"heavier rainfall. There are also combinations of green roofs with solar panels, andồạibrown"},{"y":0.42149532739066375,"h":0.017458161089650592,"x":0.1165048436605837,"w":0.77864079793294261,"t":"roofs' which are wilder in nature and maximise biodiversity. If the trend continues, it could","c":1},{"y":0.43985659801010057,"h":0.01967791382026074,"t":"create new jobs and a more vibrant and sustainable local food economy - alongside many","w":0.76515355428059906,"x":0.11838770225765709,"c":1},{"h":0.017554154797134958,"w":0.74951456705729169,"c":1,"y":0.45919003135520953,"t":"other benefits. There are still barriers to overcome, but the evidence so far indicates that","x":0.11844659991611925},{"t":"green roofs have the potential to transform cities and help them function sustainably long","w":0.76130442301432288,"h":0.021286314967265518,"y":0.47629283484602802,"c":1,"x":0.11836706788740381},{"x":0.11650486037484607,"w":0.75145629882812492,"h":0.017548721527384847,"c":1,"t":"into the future. The success stories need to be studied and replicated elsewhere, to make","y":0.49709302313866022},{"w":0.69539677937825517,"h":0.023254913852964965,"t":"green, blue, brown and food-producing roofs the norm in cities around the world.","c":1,"x":0.11829683671673043,"y":0.51368856118063266},{"x":0.88155339885619921,"w":0.029126211802164792,"t":"85","y":0.95058139538407194,"c":1,"h":0.015988371899566256}]}